@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About"; }
<section class="pub-page-top container"><p class="pub-kicker">ABOUT THE PLATFORM</p><h1>One place for the<br /><em>whole examination.</em></h1><p class="pub-lead">An online examination system that connects the people preparing a test, taking it and reviewing what happens next.</p></section>
<section class="container pub-about-photo"><img src="~/images/public/study-together.jpg" width="1200" height="800" alt="Two students preparing together with a laptop and study materials" /><p>Learning and preparation bring people together. Examination rules apply when a test begins.</p></section>
<section class="pub-section container pub-split"><div><p class="pub-kicker">WHY IT EXISTS</p><h2>Less switching between tools.<br />More clarity at each step.</h2></div><div><p>Examinations involve more than a list of questions. Teachers need to organise candidates and timing. Students need to know how to enter, save their work and find their results.</p><p>This system brings those tasks together, with separate workspaces for students, teachers and administrators.</p></div></section>
<section class="pub-section pub-tinted"><div class="container"><p class="pub-kicker">WHAT MATTERS HERE</p><div class="pub-roles"><article><h3>Clear instructions</h3><p>Understand what you need before entering an examination and where to go when you need help.</p></article><article><h3>Appropriate access</h3><p>Account roles and exam permissions control who can manage tests, review evidence and see results.</p></article><article><h3>Review with context</h3><p>Teachers can consider observations and available evidence. Technical problems and uncertain detections should be reviewed in context.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="pub-section container pub-help-bar"><div><h2>Get familiar before exam day.</h2><p>A few minutes with the guide can make your first session easier.</p></div><a class="pub-button" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="HowItWorks">Read the getting-started guide →</a></section>